# The config-apply helper is shipped disabled: enabling its socket lets
# mhvtl-control change mhVTL's configuration as root, which the operator
# decides. This preset keeps it disabled whatever the distribution's default
# presets say; the boot-recovery unit goes with it. See systemd.preset(5):
# https://www.freedesktop.org/software/systemd/man/latest/systemd.preset.html
disable mhvtl-control-apply.socket
disable mhvtl-control-apply-recover.service
